        }
        doc = "Per-strand azimuth variation in [0, 1]: adds a stable uniform offset in [-180, 180) degrees multiplied by this value. One distributes the lean around the full circle, avoiding face-axis patterns in isotropic felt. Seeded by usdGen:seed and stable strand ID, independently of length. Zero preserves existing direction. Expression evaluation: primitive (once per curve root)."
